Search (https://github.com/driceroland/Search)

Used in:
- Sources/Sill/Shield.swift: the ad and tracker rule lists (the third-party
  domains, the ad-slot selectors, the per-site slots and Reddit's promoted
  posts) and the network filter pattern.
- The Apple Passwords protocol (SRP pairing, sealed messages) and the native
  messaging pipe, as noted in README.md.

