EasyList (https://easylist.to)

About twenty of the generic ad-slot class names in Shield.swift's `slots`
list (".ad-slot", ".ad-leaderboard", ".adunit" and the like) are names that
appear in EasyList's generic element-hiding rules, and the per-site slots
follow EasyList's site rules. Sill does not bundle or download EasyList or
any other third-party filter list. Thanks to the EasyList authors.
